      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did something at work. a mistake in the codebase. i thought i checked it but i didnt... and it caused a massive system failure that cost people their data. real, irreplaceable stuff. i cant even look at my reflection without feeling like a monster. it feels like i'm just... inherently broken. like there's a rot in me that can't be fixed no matter how much i apologize or try to make it right.",
